    },
    {
      "description": "Forms have different stats and abilities.  Tornadus switches forms when the Reveal Glass is used on it.\n\nThe Reveal Glass may be obtained by taking a Therian Tornadus to Abundant Shrine.  (Landorus can be obtained in Therian Forme from the Dream Radar.)",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
